{"seq":3,"slug":"partnership-with-munger","title":"与芒格的搭档","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/partnership-with-munger","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"charlie-munger","title":"查理·芒格","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/partnership-with-munger/charlie-munger","wordCount":1480,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"mental-models-and-rationality","title":"思维模型与理性","url":"/c/people/warren-buffett/ideas-and-methods/partnership-with-munger/mental-models-and-rationality","wordCount":1455,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 与芒格的搭档\n\n查理·芒格是巴菲特一生最重要的搭档，深刻升华了他的思想。本章考察这段黄金搭档。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"查理·芒格\"——这位睿智的副手如何影响并升华了巴菲特的投资哲学。第二篇文档讲述\"思维模型与理性\",呈现二人共同推崇的跨学科思维与对理性的执着追求。\n"}